  "data": {
    "parameterized": true,
    "summary": "When this TRANSPORT is picked to shoot in your Shooting phase with units aboard, select up to X embarked models. Skip models from units already chosen to shoot that phase. For each picked model, select one ranged weapon it carries, excluding [ONE SHOT] weapons. Treat the TRANSPORT as equipped with all selected weapons as well as its own until it finishes attacking. The units aboard cannot shoot for the rest of the turn.",
